{{Term/Store|White Pigeon|White Pigeons|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''White Pigeon'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''White Pigeon'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|White Pigeon}}
White Pigeons are a variety of [[Pigeon]] with white feathers.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref><ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|This white-feathered breed of pigeon lives in the Hebra region. It's said that a wood pigeon survived atop a snowy mountain by changing its feathers to blend in with the snow and soon after became a white pigeon. They have an extra layer of fat to guard against the cold, so they have been known to yield high-quality meat.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> It is believed that they evolved from [[Wood Pigeon]]s, turning white to blend in with the snow. They are commonly found in the [[Hebra Mountains]], though they also live in the [[Gerudo Highlands]] and other snowy [[Region]]s.<ref name="Compendium"/> Their extra layer of fat protects them from [[Freezing Climate]]s, and as a result, they yield high quality [[Meat]].<ref name="Compendium"/> When they are killed, White Pigeons drop either a [[Raw Bird Thigh]] or a [[Raw Whole Bird]].

